# Option C's raw clips and their start and end frames (docs/specs/section-4-world.md 3, "Option C's clips"): the
# generator's files stay out of git, as the land masters do; their sums are committed, so a copy can be checked with
# `shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS` from this folder. raw/ holds every attempt as kling_o3_flf returned it, frames/ the start
# and end pictures sent with each job (the portrait crops at 1080 x 1920, the wide on its 16:9 canvas at 1920 x 1080).
*
!.gitignore
!SHA256SUMS
